\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2 /Sakakibara -4:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Useful For Psychology \b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 September 1996\par 03:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Sakakibara said during his closed-door meeting with business leaders that Japanese companies should take steps to limit their exposure to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  'It would be great if the dollar was stuck at 109.70 yen for the next three years, but that's unlikely to happen,' he said. \par \par \uc2  He said companies should therefore aim to make their \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  'neutral' to movements in the global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Sakakibara added that the Finance Ministry doesn't aim to protect any specific ranges, noting that markets and economic fundamentals determine \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates. He added that surveys of Japanese companies reveal varying levels of so-called ideal exchange rates. \par \par \uc2  'The perception of what a good exchange rate is varies from industry to industry and company to company,' Sakakibara said. \par \par \uc2  He said the Finance Ministry would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at times of crisis with the intent of influencing market psychology. \par \par \uc2  But he said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at merely stabilizing the market invariably fails. \par \par \uc2  'The market has to be scared (of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) or it won't work,' Sakakibara said, adding that central banks can't fight the market alone. \par \par \uc2  'Half of the market has to be already persuaded' that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates have strayed from economic fundamentals in order for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reverse a trend. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-09-96 \par \par \uc2  0111GMT \par \par \uc2  4226 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds9b07c87\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
