\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -3: More Speculation On German Rate Cut \b0\par\par\uc2 319 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1996\par 23:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Gary Sakamoto, a vice president of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at National Australia Bank in New York said he expects the dollar to continue to trade in its current ranges of 1.5000-1.5500 marks and 105.00-110.00 yen. \par \par \uc2  Despite Tuesday's fall, 'the dollar won't go much past the 107.50 yen level,' he said. 'People are fearful of that level as it may be an area where the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be lurking' to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the dollar. 'But even if it's not, it's still a caution level,' he added. \par \par \uc2  While the Bundesbank's monthly report, issued Monday, seemed to suggest that the key securities repurchase rate will remain steady, comments from a senior German monetary official Tuesday hinted otherwise. \par \par \uc2  'In my opinion, everything possible has been done by the Bundesbank to shepherd interest rates lower. And there still exists hope for lower rates under certain conditions,' Bundesbank directorate member Edgar Meister said in remarks prepared for delivery to a construction industry association. \par \par \uc2  Financial markets shouldn't rule out the possibility of lower German interest rates, despite the fact the Bundesbank already has gone far to lower rates to historical lows, Meister said. \par \par \uc2  The last time the Bundesbank cut its discount and Lombard rates was April 18, when they both fell 0.50-percentage point to 2.5% and 4.5% respectively. They are the lowest and highest rates at which banks can borrow from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But the Bundesbank has left its key money market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate - the interest charged at the weekly auction of securities repurchase agreements - at 3.30% since early February. \par \par \uc2  The next chance the Bundesbank's policy-setting \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  council will have to change the repo rate will be its June 27 regular, fortnightly session. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-06-96 \par \par \uc2  2125GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds6i051ls\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
