\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Recovers On Profit-Taking, BOJ Fears \b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 April 1996\par 02:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  C \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--After falling to a two-month low of 103.95 yen overnight, the dollar is recovering slightly in early Tokyo trading from its levels late in New York Monday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Market participants attribute the rise in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continued fears that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop the dollar up during \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's nationwide Golden Week holidays and to profit-taking by holders of long-, or over-, yen positions. \par \par \uc2  Around 0020 GMT, the dollar is trading at 105.06 yen, up from 105.00 yen around 0001 GMT and above 104.76 yen in New York late Monday. The dollar was quoted at 105.27 yen late in Sydney Monday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.5271 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.5270 marks around 0001 GMT and above 1.5268 marks late Monday in New York. The dollar was at 1.5258 marks in Sydney late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 68.80 yen, up from 68.76 yen around 0001 GMT and above 68.61 yen in New York late Monday. The mark was quoted late in Sydney Monday at 69.00 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5061, down from $1.5067 around 0001 GMT and below $1.5077 in New York late Monday. Sterling was at $1.5123 in Sydney late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Over Japan's three-day holiday weekend when the dollar fell into the 104-yen level, the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , through other central banks, likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars against yen, said a trader at a major Japanese bank. \par \par \uc2  'But the BOJ stopped half-way through,' the trader said. He cautioned, however, that if the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  falls below 104.50 yen in Asian trading Tuesday, the BOJ will most likely come in again to support the dollar. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-04-96 \par \par \uc2  0025GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4u03lpo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
