wouldn't be odd to see\par the dollar trade as low as 105 (yen), 105-plus," he said.\par "The question is will there be \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 " by the Bank of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the dollar.\par    An official from the Bank of Japan said Friday that the\par Golden Week holiday doesn't hinder the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from\par entering markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS 04-28-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1801EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4137 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011013ds4s00zvt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
