\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Midday: Dollar Gains, BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Rumored \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 April 1996\par 04:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar is higher at midday Friday compared with its levels earlier in the session after jumping on unconfirmed market rumors that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ), through the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore (MAS), \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to buy dollars around 106.10-106.20 yen, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, the dollar had hit intraday lows of 106.18 yen and 1.5306 marks at 0005 GMT on a Japanese newspaper report, subsequently denied by a BOJ official, suggesting that the BOJ may change its accomodative monetary policy stance. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said they were unable to confirm the rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials weren't immediately available for comment. MAS officials could not immediately be reached for comment. But traders said the rumors were persistent. \par \par \uc2  Around 0150 GMT, the dollar is trading at 106.65 yen, up from 106.30 yen around 0030 GMT but below 106.72 yen in New York late Thursday. The dollar was quoted at 106.78 yen in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.5330 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.5310 marks earlier in Tokyo but below 1.5339 marks late Thursday in New York. The dollar was at 1.5236 marks in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is at 69.56 yen, up from 69.43 yen earlier in Tokyo but below 69.57 yen in New York late Thursday. The mark was quoted in Tokyo late Thursday at 70.08 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5076, down from $1.5083 earlier in Tokyo and below $1.5080 in New York Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 25-04-96 \par \par \uc2  0224GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4q03jm5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
