\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dollar Recovers On Japanese Importers' Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 April 1996\par 02:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--After plunging to overnight lows of 106.40 yen and 1.4975 Deutsche marks following a surpise cut in interest rates by the German \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar is higher against the yen, but lower against most other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in early Tokyo trading Friday, compared with its levels in late New York Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Traders attribute the dollar's swift rebound versus the yen to strong buying interest in the dollar by Japanese importers and investors. They said it is unlikely that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Friday to support the dollar's brief move back above the 107.00-yen level. \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT, the dollar is trading at 106.78 yen, down from 107.14 yen around 0001 GMT but above 106.72 yen in New York late Thursday. The dollar was quoted at 108.02 yen late in Tokyo Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.5016 marks, lower than 1.5035 marks around 0001 GMT and below 1.5020 marks late Thursday in New York. The dollar was at 1.5030 marks in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5193, up from $1.5170 around 0001 GMT and above $1.5187 in New York late Thursday. Sterling was at $1.5110 in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'This is the first time in the current fiscal year that dollar is below 107 yen, so (Japanese importers) are buying dollars up,' said a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Bank of America in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-04-96 \par \par \uc2  0044GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4j03c4q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
