\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ says money policy aimed at ensuring recovery. \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, March 6 (Reuter) - The Bank of Japan (BOJ) will implement its monetary policy with the aim of ensuring the nation's economic recovery, BOJ Governor Yasuo Matsushita told a news conference on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Asked to comment on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stance on monetary policy, Matsushita said: "For the time being, we will put emphasis on keeping economic recovery securely in place." \par \par \uc2  He added that it was important for the BOJ to continue monitoring market movements carefully. \par \par \uc2  He declined to comment on recent fluctuations in Japanese money market rates. \par \par \uc2  He said it was desirable for the markets to create an appropriate level in interest rates, but added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would send signals to let its monetary stance be known if necessary. \par \par \uc2  Asked to comment on the pact on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  which \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary authorities recently reached with counterparts in Singapore and Hong Kong, Matsushita said: "The aim of the pact was to tackle unexpected gyrations in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets." \par \par \uc2  Under the agreement, the BOJ can ask its Hong Kong and Singaporean counterparts to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in dollar-yen trading on its behalf. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita said the effect of BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would by strengthened by the expansion of the scope of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He said the pact was not intended as an expression of a specific policy. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019ds3600s4n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
