\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar Up Late In Asia Following Limited BOJ Boost \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 1996\par 07:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Despite yet another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar is only moderately higher Thursday from its levels in New York late Wednesday, traders say. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ was spotted buying dollars around the 105.50 yen level around 0025 GMT. Rumors that the BOJ continued to buy the dollar persisted throughout the Tokyo afternoon, but dealers were unable to confirm \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity. \par \par \uc2  'It's difficult to read what the BOJ wants to do,' said Makoto Kojima, director of global money markets and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Barclays Bank in Tokyo, although traders say the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has revealed its hand from repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week to support the dollar around 105.00 yen. \par \par \uc2  While many market players say BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the primary factor for the dollar remaining at current levels, traders say \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have less of an impact as time goes by. However, solid support is seen for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 104.80/90 yen from buying interest by importers and U.S. funds, said a spot dealer at a Japanese long-term credit bank. \par \par \uc2  Around 0530 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 105.28 yen, above 104.97 yen late Wednesday in New York and up from 105.10 yen late Wednesday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.4510 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.4495 marks late Wednesday in New York but below 1.4525 marks in London Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 72.56 yen, up from 72.42 yen in New York late Wednesday and above 72.36 yen in London late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0600GMT \par \par \uc2  28038 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01lip\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
