 in New York and up from 105.10 yen late Wednesday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.4510 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.4495 marks late Wednesday in New York but below 1.4525 marks in London Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 72.56 yen, up from 72.42 yen in New York late Wednesday and above 72.36 yen in London late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0542GMT \par \par \uc2  1034 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01lh3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
