\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Midday: Dlr Flat;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Keeping Range Narrow \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 1996\par 03:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar is flat to slightly weaker midday in Tokyo Thursday than its levels early in the session, having settled into a narrow range after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the part of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 0200 GMT, the dollar is trading at 105.47 yen, down from 105.50 yen around 0030 GMT but above 104.97 yen in New York late Wednesday. The dollar was quoted at 105.15 yen in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.4530 Deutsche marks, unchanged from earlier in Tokyo but above 1.4495 marks late Wednesday in New York. The dollar was at 1.4540 marks in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is at 72.59 yen, just below 72.61 yen earlier in Tokyo but above 72.42 yen in New York late Wednesday. The mark was quoted in Tokyo late Wednesday at 72.31 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5425,up from $1.5415 earlier in Tokyo but below $1.5443 in New York late Wednesday. Sterling was at $1.5470 in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  While traders said the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would probably continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an effort to keep the dollar above 105.00 yen, the market could grow complacent about the BOJ's efforts. \par \par \uc2  'If they continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the feeling is going to be, `Oh, again?' and (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will lose its effectiveness,' said a trader at a Japanese bank. \par \par \uc2  But others were unwilling to simply dismiss the BOJ, and said the dollar's downside around 104.70 yen was well-supported. The dollar is expected to trade between 104.80-105.80 yen for the rest of Tokyo trading, and 1.4450-1.4550 marks. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0206GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01l4k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
