\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Up As BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Rumors Persist \b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 1996\par 01:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar has moved up sharply in early Tokyo trading Thursday from its levels late in New York Wednesday, with traders all but sure the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  'We think they bought around 105.10 (yen), but there's no way to tell,' said a trader at a Japanese bank. \par \par \uc2  Other traders said they thought the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought at 105.30 yen and 105.50 yen. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at an American bank in Tokyo said the only question was whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be content with protecting the dollar's downside around 105.00 yen, or would buy as the dollar rose, and try to push it up past 106.00 yen. \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT, the dollar is trading at 105.50 yen, up from 105.45 yen around 0001 GMT and well above 104.97 yen in New York late Wednesday. The dollar was quoted at 105.15 yen late in Tokyo Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.4530 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.4525 marks around 0001 GMT and well above 1.4495 marks late Wednesday in New York. The dollar was at 1.4540 marks in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 72.61 yen, up from 72.60 yen around 0001 GMT and above 72.42 yen in New York late Wednesday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Wednesday at 72.31 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5415, unchanged from around 0001 GMT but below $1.5443 in New York late Wednesday. Sterling was at $1.5470 in Tokyo late Wednesday. - \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0038GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01ktn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
