ch cooperation is important in view of rapid development of financial markets in Asia.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-02-96 \par \par \uc2  1129GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01khi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
