 $1.5445, up from $1.5440 around 0001 GMT but below $1.5457 in New York late Tuesday. Sterling was at $1.5465 in Tokyo late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0037GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2l01jzx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
