\par\par \b \uc2  Japan  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 /Rumors BOJ Buying -2: Dlr Near Intraday Highs \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 1996\par 02:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar has continued its early gains Tuesday amid talk among dealers that the Bank of Japan has been buying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  between 104.20 yen and 104.90 yen. \par \par \uc2  The dollar started its movement up early in Asian trading, on short-covering in anticipation of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and reached a high of 104.92 yen around 0338 GMT. Traders said it was difficult to confirm \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but there was little doubt among many of them that the BOJ had come in, and would continue to be a force in the market for the rest of the day. \par \par \uc2  Around 0133 GMT, the dollar is at 104.82 yen, well above 103.95 yen in London late Monday but below 105.13 yen in Tokyo late Monday. The New York market was closed Moday for a national holiday. \par \par \uc2  It is also trading at 1.4488 Deutsche marks, near its intraday high of 1.4490, around 0035 GMT, up from 1.4450 marks in London late Monday but below 1.4500 marks in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 72.35 yen, up from 71.94 yen in London late Monday. The mark was quoted late Monday in Tokyo at 72.50 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5482, up from $1.5460 in London late Monday. Sterling was at $1.5460 in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0145GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2k01j8q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex10